      "description": "Every point of Elemental Mastery Yae Miko possesses will increase Sesshou Sakura DMG by 0.15%.",
      "level": 4,
      "img": "https://pub-1ad979b6618d4a07ab871591a84b954c.r2.dev/yae/talent-passive-2.png"
    },
    {
      "name": "Meditations of a Yako",
      "unlock": "Unlocked Automatically",
      "description": "Has a 25% chance to get 1 regional Character Talent Material (base material excluded) when crafting. The rarity is that of the base material.",
      "img": "https://pub-1ad979b6618d4a07ab871591a84b954c.r2.dev/yae/talent-passive-0.png"
    },
    {
      "name": "Edict of Cleansing",
      "unlock": "Unlocked Automatically",
      "description": "Extends the duration of the Sesshou Sakura by 10s. When a nearby party member triggers a Superconduct or Stellar-Conduct reaction, the next instance of Sesshou Sakura lightning is enhanced as follows: DMG dealt is increased at 80% of Yae Miko's ATK. This effect can trigger once every 2.5s.\nRadiance: Stellar-Conduct: An enhanced Sesshou Sakura lightning bolt hit on an opponent will also cause an additional instance of Electro DMG at 200% of Yae Miko's ATK. This DMG is considered Stellar-Conduct DMG.\nAdditionally, when inside a Polestar Field, Yae Miko will enter the Radiance: Stellar-Conduct state.",
      "img": "https://pub-1ad979b6618d4a07ab871591a84b954c.r2.dev/yae/talent-passive-extra-3.png"
    }
  ],
